OL,3,GNEWSARapist bus driver who targeted
OL,4,Apassengers jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former bus driver who raped a teenage
OL,7,Fgirl and sexually assaulted two others
OL,8,Fhas been jailed.
OL,10,FJames Robert Edward, 26, admitted in
OL,11,Fthe Royal Court to raping a 16-year-old
OL,12,Fgirl and sexually touching two other
OL,13,Fgirls aged 15.
OL,15,FGilbert also pleaded guilty to a
OL,16,Ffurther act of sexual assault on an
OL,17,Fwoman at her workplace. He was
OL,18,Fsentenced to 15 years and six months in
OL,19,Fjail.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
